{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "c2aab92d-dd19-83e1-90ba-fafe03c2fa22",
  "created_at": "2026-01-08T12:33:11-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rui Teixeira",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T12:32:07-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T12:32:11-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. I'm calling about a streetlight on my street. It's been switched to something really bright and it shines straight into my bedroom window. I can't sleep with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T12:32:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's no good. Is it a new bulb, or has it always been like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T12:32:24-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It changed a couple weeks ago. Before that it was a dull yellow. Now it's white and it lights up the whole room. I put a blanket over the curtain. Doesn't help."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T12:32:33-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Which street is the pole on? Do you have a number from the pole?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T12:32:38-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm not giving my own address, but it's the pole right in front of the house across from the corner market. I didn't read a number. Can you send a crew to check the pole? Maybe the fixture is wrong or it's aimed wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T12:32:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I'll put in a request for a crew to look at it. Can I get a callback number in case they have questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T12:32:57-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. 401-555-0199. Sorry, my speaker is cracked. It buzzes on high notes, so if I sound off, that's why."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T12:33:03-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I can hear you fine. I've got it down. Someone should take a look in the coming days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T12:33:09-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thanks."
    }
  ],
